# WP30 on Shard (L5), 2 stock clients on sync-routers.msav (SyncRoutersMap.java) in survival: core-shard at 8,8 on
# open stone, a router field at 20..39 x 20..29. Alpha breaks ten routers of the field for their copper (Shard's
# hosted world keeps the map's empty core: it doesn't apply the loadout yet), builds a conveyor line and a router from
# that copper, and breaks the line's middle. Bravo, who builds nothing, sees each block appear and go as the server's
# Calls and block snapshots say: no construction site or block left behind (a ghost), no rebuild plan, and, after a
# rejoin, the same blocks in a fresh world stream. The end-of-run checks fail on "Missing entity" and every other
# desync line. Only ported blocks: a live-built block of a kind Shard doesn't port, such as a wall, can't be written
# into a world stream yet.
#
#   scripts/vm-gradle.sh :server:installDist
#   rig/run.sh --vm "$(cat .vm-id)" --server 'mkdir -p maps && cp /home/user/shard/rig/scenarios/sync-routers.msav maps/routers.msav \
#     && PUSH=/home/user/shard/server/build/install/shard exec "$RIG"/vm/shard-server.sh routers' --clients 2 --script rig/scenarios/shard-build.rig
timeout 8m

wait port 90s
alpha: join
bravo: join
all: shot joined
# 16 px a tile: the core and the field's first row both on screen
alpha: zoom 2

# deconstruct ten routers: each refunds half its 3 copper, rounded
alpha: drag right tile 20 20 tile 29 20
alpha: expect tile 20 20 air 30s
alpha: expect tile 29 20 air 30s
bravo: expect tile 20 20 air 30s
bravo: expect tile 25 20 air 10s
bravo: expect tile 29 20 air 10s
bravo: expect tile 20 21 router 5s
alpha: expect js "Vars.player.team().core().items.get(Items.copper)" /^[1-9][0-9]*(\.0)?$/ 10s
all: shot routers-broken

# a conveyor line right of the core and a router above its start, paid with that copper
alpha: select conveyor
alpha: rotate 0
alpha: drag left tile 11 8 tile 15 8
alpha: place router tile 11 10
alpha: expect tile 11 8 conveyor 30s
alpha: expect tile 15 8 conveyor 30s
alpha: expect tile 11 10 router 30s
bravo: expect tile 11 8 conveyor 30s
bravo: expect tile 12 8 conveyor 10s
bravo: expect tile 13 8 conveyor 10s
bravo: expect tile 14 8 conveyor 10s
bravo: expect tile 15 8 conveyor 10s
bravo: expect tile 11 10 router 10s
all: shot built

# a right click drops the selection; a right drag breaks the line's middle three
alpha: click right tile 8 3
alpha: expect selected none
alpha: drag right tile 12 8 tile 14 8
alpha: expect tile 13 8 air 30s
bravo: expect tile 12 8 air 30s
bravo: expect tile 13 8 air 10s
bravo: expect tile 14 8 air 10s
bravo: expect tile 11 8 conveyor 5s
bravo: expect tile 15 8 conveyor 5s
all: shot line-broken

# no construction site anywhere, and no rebuild plan: nothing was destroyed. Wait out a block snapshot (6 s) first.
wait 7s
all: expect js "(function(){var n=0;Vars.world.tiles.eachTile(function(t){if(t.block().name.startsWith('build'))n++});return n})()" /^0(\.0)?$/ 10s
all: expect js "Vars.player.team().data().plans.size" /^0(\.0)?$/ 10s

# a fresh world stream has the same blocks
bravo: rejoin
bravo: expect tile 11 8 conveyor 30s
bravo: expect tile 13 8 air 10s
bravo: expect tile 15 8 conveyor 10s
bravo: expect tile 11 10 router 10s
bravo: expect tile 25 20 air 10s
all: shot rejoined

assert clean all
assert clean server
